护规则和海关进口法规，但数据隐私、销售税等领域由各州自行立法，导致合规复杂度极高——加州 CCPA、科罗拉多 CPA、弗吉尼亚 VCDPA 等隐私法各有差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规风险评估\">合规风险评估</h2><p>系统化的合规风险评估是进入新市场前的必要步骤。评估框架需要覆盖法律风险、运营风险和声誉风险三个维度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RiskAssessment {&#10;  readonly market: string;&#10;  readonly dimensions: ReadonlyArray&lt;{&#10;    readonly name: string;&#10;    readonly riskLevel: number;&#10;    readonly likelihood: number;&#10;    readonly impact: number;&#10;    readonly mitigationStrategies: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;;&#10;    readonly estimatedMitigationCost: number;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const computeRiskMatrix = (&#10;  assessment: RiskAssessment,&#10;): ReadonlyArray&lt;{ readonly name: string; readonly priority: string; readonly score: number }&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  return assessment.dimensions&#10;    .map((d) =&gt; ({&#10;      name: d.name,&#10;      score: d.likelihood * d.impact,&#10;      priority: d.likelihood * d.impact &gt; 6 ? &#39;critical&#39; : d.likelihood * d.impact &gt; 3 ? &#39;high&#39; : &#39;medium&#39;,&#10;    }))&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.score - a.score);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RiskAssessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> market</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#